==Trivia==
* Only [[Middle Town]] has the homepoint NPC in First Sea.
* Only [[Desert]], [[Skylands|Lower Skylands]], [[Colosseum (First Sea)|Colosseum]] and the starter islands don't have bosses, Every other island has a boss.
* The First Sea is the sea where players begin their journey as a [[Pirates|Pirate]] or a [[Marines|Marine]]. 
* The First Sea got a Full Rework in Update 30, revamping all the islands, and changing the enemies in [[Prison]] a second time.
* The First Sea is the first sea to receive a Sea Rework.
* Players with high bounty can only summon one [[Sea Beast]]. 

